{"id": "t014-001", "text": "hemi's knee op is 14 May, 8am at the royal. he's been on the waiting list nearly 2 yrs so mostly relieved, but his wife says he's been snappy all wk and not sleeping. off work 6 wks after, his boss is being decent about it. physio starts the wk after. remind me to text him the night b4 and maybe pop round w/ a few beers once he's home", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 May, 8am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly 2 yrs"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "snappy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "all wk"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 wks after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night b4", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round w/ a few beers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "once he's home", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t014-009", "text": "anya off work for a bit after the gallbladder thing. op was monday, recovering at her mum's in york", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder thing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
