{"id": "t014-032", "text": "cem's hearing test got cancelled again, third time. nhs say they'll rebook in the new year. meanwhile his wife yara has her own appt for her back on 6 dec at 9.20, she's been in agony since the summer and can barely sit at her desk. cem is doing all the school runs. their eldest has mock exams the same wk so the house is chaos apparently", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "yara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appt", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 dec at 9.20", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in agony", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can barely sit at her desk", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock exams", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same wk", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t014-033", "text": "noor mentioned shes doing her nursing finals in jan, hoping to get a job at the same ward after. she's done placements there since 2nd yr. her boyfriend jamal is also a student nurse but a yr behind. they live together near the hospital in a tiny flat w/ a cat called pickle. said she'd love a decent stethoscope for xmas, hint hint, the littmann one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursing finals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hoping to get a job at the same ward", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "done placements there", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since 2nd yr"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jamal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "student nurse", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "a yr behind", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "live together near the hospital in a tiny flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat called pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent stethoscope", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "xmas"}, {"id": "f9", "type": "FACT", "text": "littmann one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t014-038", "text": "kieran's knee surgery 1st of december at 7.30am. he'll be off crutches by xmas hopefully. need to ask if he needs a lift to the hospital", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kieran", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st of december at 7.30am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off crutches", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by xmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if he needs a lift to the hospital", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
