{"id": "t014-045", "text": "called shanice - her biopsy results are back clear!! she was terrified for wks. her husband marcus took her out for dinner to celebrate. she said she'd been dreading opening the letter so her sister opened it for her. back at work monday, going to take it easy til xmas. should send flowers or something small, she loves those orange roses", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "marcus", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "til xmas"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "orange roses", "owner": "p1"}]}
